           Append a single row to the end of a ``DataFrame`` object.
       
           >>> df7 = pd.DataFrame({'a': 1, 'b': 2}, index=[0])
           >>> df7
               a   b
           0   1   2
           >>> new_row = pd.Series({'a': 3, 'b': 4})
           >>> new_row
           a    3
           b    4
           dtype: int64
           >>> pd.concat([df7, new_row.to_frame().T], ignore_index=True)
